PTX MP+mbarrier-try_wait-relaxed+fence-restrict
"The manual's idiom (22749): a relaxed try_wait followed by fence.acquire.sync_restrict::shared::cluster orders the later shared-memory load (D17). Expected: forbidden."
{
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 1;
s=0 @cta 1;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                          | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0                             ;
 st.weak.shared::cluster s, 1                      | mbarrier.try_wait.parity.relaxed.cluster r0, b, 0    ;
 mbarrier.arrive.release.cluster.shared::cluster b | fence.acquire.sync_restrict::shared::cluster.cluster ;
                                                   | ld.weak.shared::cta r1, s                            ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
